      "url": "https://github.com/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/releases/tag/v0.6.2",
      "notes_html": "<h2>v0.6.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Long Windows paths: installer warns when the OS opt-in is off, one-click Enable in Manage → Troubleshooting (asks permission, needs admin + reboot), and setup offers to enable before downloading anything</li>\n<li>Gallery keeps your last results again: the launcher seeds the gallery-retention default when writing settings (a missing key used to wipe the gallery on every generation)</li>\n<li>Installer no longer asks twice: backup choice sticks to your radio pick, your picks survive panel refreshes, and foreign folders get one clear question instead of a silent loop</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Full history: CHANGELOG.md</p>",
      "assets": [
