    {
      "title": "v0.6.1",
      "updated": "2026-09-11T14:20:12Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/releases/tag/v0.6.1",
      "notes_html": "<h2>v0.6.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Native-view drag &amp; drop fixed: the child webview opts out of Tauri file-drop interception, so drops reach Gradio</li>\n<li>Closing the launcher now actually stops servers: no more orphaned Wan2GP/OpenCode processes surviving app close</li>\n<li>Stop hardening: OpenCode :4096 port-sweep fallback across restarts, custom-port python-listener sweep, unique per-launch terminal scripts + temp cleanup</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Full history: CHANGELOG.md</p>",
      "assets": [
