    {
      "title": "v0.6.0",
      "updated": "2026-09-11T13:20:36Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/releases/tag/v0.6.0",
      "notes_html": "<p>Native Desktop embed (default): real child Webview with browser-grade Save-As downloads, floating console as its own window, one console stream everywhere, stall-free Stop that kills rebuild orphans, view-transition mutex plus Stop teardown (no stale UI states). AMD install fix (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5408566796\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/issues/15\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/issues/15/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GKartist75/Wan2GP-Desktop-Tauri/issues/15\">#15</a>): setup.py is now driven through a hook module, no more source patching.</p>",
